<h2 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 2"'>5. Web Interface Guide</h2>
<p>The system provides a comprehensive web interface accessible at <code>http://<ESP32_IP>/</code></p>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>5.1 Available Routes</h3>
<table border='1' style='border-collapse:collapse'>
<tr><th style='background:#DDD;padding:4px'>Route</th><th style='background:#DDD;padding:4px'>Method</th><th style='background:#DDD;padding:4px'>Description</th><th style='background:#DDD;padding:4px'>Authentication</th></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Main dashboard (redirects to /Display)</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/Display`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Real-time monitoring with current readings</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/Information`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>System info (version, uptime, memory, WiFi)</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/DownloadFiles`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>File download interface - list and select</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/GetFile`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Download selected file (CSV or ZIP)</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/DeleteFiles`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>File deletion interface - list and select</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/DelFile`</td><td style='padding:4px'>POST</td><td style='padding:4px'>Delete selected file</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/DeletePreviousMonth`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Bulk delete previous month's daily files</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/ConfirmDeletePrevMonth`</td><td style='padding:4px'>POST</td><td style='padding:4px'>Confirm bulk deletion</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/Reset`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Remotely reboot the ESP32</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/WhatsApp`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Send test WhatsApp message</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/ConfigUpload`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Configuration file upload interface</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/DownloadConfig`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>Download current config.json to PC</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/UploadConfig`</td><td style='padding:4px'>POST</td><td style='padding:4px'>Upload new config.json from PC and reboot</td><td style='padding:4px'>No</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/Firmware`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>OTA login page</td><td style='padding:4px'>**Yes - OTA creds**</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/serverIndex`</td><td style='padding:4px'>GET</td><td style='padding:4px'>OTA file upload page</td><td style='padding:4px'>**Yes - Post-login**</td></tr>
<tr><td style='padding:4px'>`/update`</td><td style='padding:4px'>POST</td><td style='padding:4px'>OTA firmware upload handler</td><td style='padding:4px'>**Yes - Post-login**</td></tr>
