<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>5.2 Main Dashboard (/Display)</h3>
<p><b>Displays:</b></p>
<li>Current Date and Time (synchronized via NTP)</li>
<li>Current chart with dynamic linear Y-axis scaling for improved low-range visibility</li>
<li>Horizontal slider for panning through time windows</li>
<li>Real-time sensor readings:</li>
<p>  - Voltage (V)</p>
<p>  - Current (A)</p>
<p>  - Power (W)</p>
<p>  - Energy (kWh)</p>
<p>  - Power Factor</p>
<p>  - Frequency (Hz)</p>
<p>  - Temperature (C)</p>
<li>Min/Max statistics:</li>
<p>  - Lowest/Highest Voltage with timestamps</p>
<p>  - Highest Current with timestamp</p>
<li>Weather information (if enabled):</li>
<p>  - Temperature (current, feels like, min, max)</p>
<p>  - Atmospheric pressure</p>
<p>  - Humidity</p>
<p>  - Wind speed and direction</p>
<li>System status:</li>
<p>  - WiFi signal strength</p>
<p>  - SD card usage</p>
<p>  - Uptime</p>
<p><b>Buttons:</b></p>
<li>Information - View system details</li>
<li>Download Files - Access data files</li>
<li>Delete Files - Manage storage</li>
<li>Delete Previous Month - Bulk cleanup</li>
<li>Send WhatsApp - Test notifications</li>
<li>Reset - Reboot system</li>
<li>Firmware Update - OTA upload</li>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>5.3 Information Page (/Information)</h3>
<p><b>Displays:</b></p>
<li>Software version (e.g., V1.1.1)</li>
<li>Build timestamp</li>
<li>ESP32 hardware details</li>
<li>RAM usage (bytes and percentage)</li>
<li>Flash usage (bytes and percentage)</li>
<li>WiFi SSID and signal strength (RSSI)</li>
<li>IP address</li>
<li>MAC address</li>
<li>SD card status and space</li>
<li>Configuration settings</li>
<li>Last boot time</li>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>5.4 File Management Pages</h3>
<h4 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 4"'>Download Files (/DownloadFiles)</h4>
<li>Lists all CSV and ZIP files on SD card</li>
<li>Shows file sizes</li>
<li>Click filename to download</li>
<li>Supports daily files (DF_YYYYMMDD.csv) and monthly files (MF_MM.zip)</li>
<h4 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 4"'>Delete Files (/DeleteFiles)</h4>
<li>Lists all files with checkboxes</li>
<li>Select multiple files for deletion</li>
<li>Confirmation required before delete</li>
<li>Shows freed space after deletion</li>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>5.5 Remote Control Pages</h3>
<h4 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 4"'>Reset (/Reset)</h4>
<li>Sends WhatsApp notification: "Resetting Processor from Webpage at HH:MM:SS"</li>
<li>Performs ESP.restart() after 2 seconds</li>
<li>System reboots and resumes normal operation</li>
<h4 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 4"'>WhatsApp Test (/WhatsApp)</h4>
<li>Sends test message: "Sending Test Message from Webpage at HH:MM:SS"</li>
<li>Confirms WhatsApp API connectivity</li>
<li>Useful for troubleshooting notifications</li>
<h2 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 2"'>6. OTA Firmware Updates</h2>
<p>For complete OTA instructions, see OTA_SECURITY_UPDATE.md</p>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>6.1 Quick Reference</h3>
<p><b>Access:</b> <code>http://<ESP32_IP>/Firmware</code></p>
<p><b>Default Credentials:</b></p>
<li>Username: `SteveG`</li>
<li>Password: `W00dle1gh`</li>
