<p>6. ESP32 automatically reboots</p>
<p>7. Browser may briefly disconnect during reboot, then reconnect</p>
<h2 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 2"'>7. Configuration System</h2>
<h3 style='mso-style-name:"Heading 3"'>7.1 config.json File</h3>
<p><b>Location:</b> <code>/config.json</code> (SD card root directory)</p>
<p><b>Format:</b> JSON (human-readable, editable with any text editor)</p>
<p><b>Sample Configuration:</b></p>
<p><code>`</code>json</p>
<p>{</p>
<p>  "wifi_ssid": "Woodleigh",</p>
<p>  "wifi_password": "2008198399",</p>
<p>  "ntp_server": "pool.ntp.org",</p>
<p>  "weather_city": "Basingstoke",</p>
<p>  "weather_region": "uk",</p>
<p>  "weather_enabled": true,</p>
<p>  "whatsapp_enabled": true,</p>
<p>  "gas_meter_enabled": false,</p>
<p>  "debug_level": 2,</p>
<p>  "main_cycle_ms": 5000,</p>
<p>  "weather_update_ms": 600000,</p>
<p>  "health_check_ms": 60000,</p>
<p>  "ota_username": "SteveG",</p>
<p>  "ota_password": "W00dle1gh"</p>
<p>}</p>
<p><code>`</code></p>
